      "end": 4.502,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "在隆盛国煮子之前，将米香放汤煮的豆腐放里头。",
      "score": 0.73,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.561,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.5,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.2,
        "phon_examples": "煮/足 隆/浓",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "在浓盛过足这支鲜，将底香仿糖煮的豆腐坊里头。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.782,
      "end": 8.662,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "当地村民杨成武正忙到泡豆打浆。",
      "score": 0.0133,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0448,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.026,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "当地村民杨成武正忙到泡豆打浆。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.0,
      "end": 15.788,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "他告诉记者，连冠奖金不少，当地人都到他这来买豆腐做豆腐酿。",
      "score": 0.64,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.436,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.941,
        "seg_cer": 0.192,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "酿/凉",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "他告诉记者：“连贯将近，不少当地人都到他这里来买豆腐，做豆腐凉。”"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 16.073,
      "end": 19.78,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "而制作豆腐酿的过程看似简单，实则讲究。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "而制作豆腐酿的过程，看似简单，实则讲究。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 20.038,
      "end": 26.723,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "先将切成规整的精选三国豆腐放入六成热的油锅当中，",
      "score": 0.1837,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0681,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.08,
        "seg_cer": 0.174,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.25,
        "phon_examples": "三/山",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "先将切成规整的新鲜山果豆腐放入六成热的油锅当中。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 26.923,
      "end": 29.927,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "随着油温的传递，豆腐慢慢膨胀，",
      "score": 0.0703,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.154,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "吃到油温的传递，豆腐慢慢膨胀。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 30.081,
      "end": 32.672,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "逐渐变得圆鼓鼓、肥嘟嘟，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0154,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "逐渐变得圆鼓鼓、肥嘟嘟。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 33.0,
      "end": 37.11,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "色泽也从温润的洁白转为诱人的金黄，",
      "score": 0.1191,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0848,
